    {
      "text": "It's funny because I can talk just fine in real life, but the second that little red light comes on, I forget how to speak. Suddenly, every word sounds weird, every pause feels awkward, and my voice doesn't even sound like me anymore. I deleted another one, sighed, and thought, \"Why is this so hard?\" I wasn't sending a podcast. It was a 30-second message. I guess it really comes down to wanting to sound casual while still sounding like I have my life together, which honestly is impossible. ",
